# Every value is optional except DIYANET_API_KEY.

# --- Diyanet Prayer Times API ----------------------------------------------
# Create a key with the scopes places:read, prayer-times:read and
# daily-content:read. See https://diyanetapi.mennova.nl/scalar. The key stays on
# the server; the browser only talks to this app's own /api routes.
DIYANET_API_KEY=
# DIYANET_API_URL=https://diyanetapi.mennova.nl

